name dprogress
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc LaTeX-relevant log information for debugging
relocated 1
longdesc The package logs LaTeX's progress through the file, making the
longdesc LaTeX output more verbose. This helps to make LaTeX debugging
longdesc easier, as it is simpler to find where exactly LaTeX failed.
longdesc The package outputs the typesetting of section, subsection and
longdesc subsubsection headers and (if amsmath is loaded) details of the
longdesc align environment.
runfiles size=2
